.TH openalex-snapshot 1
.SH NAME
openalex-snapshot \- OpenAlex snapshot pipeline CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openalex-snapshot
.RI [COMMAND] [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Root-dir-first CLI for the OpenAlex snapshot, which is now published natively in parquet.
The pipeline is download -> verify_download -> (auto) enrich -> index -> extract.
Argument precedence: CLI arguments > config subcommand section > config defaults section > built-in defaults.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B check
Environment/capacity preflight checks.
.TP
.B download
Download the parquet snapshot from S3 (auto-enriches works).
.TP
.B verify_download
Validate the parquet corpus against the published manifest.
.TP
.B enrich
Add abstract + citation columns to works (works_aws/ -> works/).
.TP
.B index
Build lookup index parquet.
.TP
.B extract
Extract records by IDs using indexes.
.TP
.B verify_index
Verify index integrity.
.TP
.B report
Show run reports.
.TP
.B prune-reports
Prune old reports.
.TP
.B progress
Show live run progress.
.TP
.B skills
Bootstrap `skills/` folder for AI agents.
.TP
.B config
Create/verify YAML config.
.TP
.B convert
[DEPRECATED] Convert legacy JSON.GZ snapshots to parquet.
.TP
.B verify_convert
[DEPRECATED] Verify legacy snapshot/parquet parity.
.TP
.B schema
[DEPRECATED] Inspect schema of a legacy JSON snapshot.
.TP
.B verify_schema
[DEPRECATED] Assert schema parity across legacy sources.
.SH EXAMPLES
openalex-snapshot download --root-dir /data

openalex-snapshot verify_download --root-dir /data

openalex-snapshot enrich --root-dir /data

openalex-snapshot index --root-dir /data --dataset all

openalex-snapshot extract --root-dir /data --ids /data/ids.csv --output /data/extract.parquet
.SH SEE ALSO
openalex-snapshot-download(1), openalex-snapshot-verify_download(1), openalex-snapshot-enrich(1), openalex-snapshot-index(1), openalex-snapshot-extract(1), openalex-snapshot-skills(1), openalex-snapshot-check(1)
